(4686404, 675449, 88204, '<td valign="top">This is quite a shot! It''s so odd to see a working many with dirty hands with no clothes on. No matter how you slice it it''s strange. Interesting composition with the center subject and triangle of light, leading lines of the rails. Nicely exposed in a somewhat challenging lighting situation.<br/> <br/>Odd but well done!</td>', 'This is quite a shot! It''s so odd to see a working many with dirty hands with no clothes on. No matter how you slice it it''s strange. Interesting composition with the center subject and triangle of light, leading lines of the rails. Nicely exposed in a somewhat challenging lighting situation. Odd but well done!', '2008-05-07 07:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
