(4688456, 676648, 89333, '<td valign="top">Excellent image. I find the little bit of light at the upper left somewhat distracting. (Would be great to burn in if not in basic editing.)</td>', 'Excellent image. I find the little bit of light at the upper left somewhat distracting. (Would be great to burn in if not in basic editing.)', '2008-05-07 22:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4688458, 675427, 89333, '<td valign="top">Very graphic and great colors. I would have like to see a touch more space on top. (I don''t like to have elements just touching the edge of the image.)</td>', 'Very graphic and great colors. I would have like to see a touch more space on top. (I don''t like to have elements just touching the edge of the image.)', '2008-05-07 22:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4688460, 676154, 89333, '<td valign="top">Excellent image. Very graphical and great use of the multiple triangles. I think cropping the top to eliminate the rings makes it somewhat stronger as they are a bit distracting.</td>', 'Excellent image. Very graphical and great use of the multiple triangles. I think cropping the top to eliminate the rings makes it somewhat stronger as they are a bit distracting.', '2008-05-07 22:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4688461, 676683, 89333, '<td valign="top">Very effective lighting. I would have preferred not having the "SCIENTIST" as it distracts from the steeple. (I realize it was not possible to eliminate this in basic editing.) I think the tilting works well.</td>', 'Very effective lighting. I would have preferred not having the "SCIENTIST" as it distracts from the steeple. (I realize it was not possible to eliminate this in basic editing.) I think the tilting works well.', '2008-05-07 22:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4688462, 676543, 89333, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors. I think the bottom is a bit empty and I find the cutoff orchid at the top distracting and would have preferred to see it all.</td>', 'Very nice colors. I think the bottom is a bit empty and I find the cutoff orchid at the top distracting and would have preferred to see it all.', '2008-05-07 22:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4688463, 675792, 89333, '<td valign="top">Nice image. The right needs a bit more light as the skull merges with the background (especially the back of the eye socket and just under the eye socket).</td>', 'Nice image. The right needs a bit more light as the skull merges with the background (especially the back of the eye socket and just under the eye socket).', '2008-05-07 22:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4688464, 675619, 89333, '<td valign="top">Interesting image and very interesting use of triangles. However, I don''t really like the centering of the ant and I would prefer to not have the left berry so out of focus.</td>', 'Interesting image and very interesting use of triangles. However, I don''t really like the centering of the ant and I would prefer to not have the left berry so out of focus.', '2008-05-07 22:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4688465, 675613, 89333, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and exposure. I find the out-of-focus stick very distracting and feel it cuts the snake (especially with the right being in focus and the left out of focus).</td>', 'Nice colors and exposure. I find the out-of-focus stick very distracting and feel it cuts the snake (especially with the right being in focus and the left out of focus).', '2008-05-07 22:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4688466, 676807, 89333, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic sky. However, I don''t think the image works. The real center of interest should be the graffiti in the triangle, but my eye is drawn to the railing as well as the sky. Maybe if you had gotten down lower and shifted to the left to eliminate the railing.</td>', 'Nice dramatic sky. However, I don''t think the image works. The real center of interest should be the graffiti in the triangle, but my eye is drawn to the railing as well as the sky. Maybe if you had gotten down lower and shifted to the left to eliminate the railing.', '2008-05-07 22:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4688467, 676650, 89333, '<td valign="top">The tulip is very nicely lit. However, I think the background is too distracting and takes up too much of the image. Also, the leaf intruding from the left is distracting. (Perhaps you could have simply held it out of the way during the exposure.)</td>', 'The tulip is very nicely lit. However, I think the background is too distracting and takes up too much of the image. Also, the leaf intruding from the left is distracting. (Perhaps you could have simply held it out of the way during the exposure.)', '2008-05-07 22:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4688469, 676063, 89333, '<td valign="top">Overall, the bird is in a nice pose. However, I find at least 3 problems with the image: 1) the bird''s neck/head is underexposed, 2) the far right brightness distracts from bird, and 3) the right third or so of the image isn''t interesting. Cropping out the right part of the image would solve 2 and 3 and enhance the image.</td>', 'Overall, the bird is in a nice pose. However, I find at least 3 problems with the image: 1) the bird''s neck/head is underexposed, 2) the far right brightness distracts from bird, and 3) the right third or so of the image isn''t interesting. Cropping out the right part of the image would solve 2 and 3 and enhance the image.', '2008-05-07 22:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
