(4688971, 676251, 62249, '<td valign="top">You definitely got a triangle composition, but not sharp enough, probably due to shooting at slow speed in low light. Also, crop off the left edge to omit whatever that dark bit is near the upper left corner. Consider cropping off some of the foreground too.</td>', 'You definitely got a triangle composition, but not sharp enough, probably due to shooting at slow speed in low light. Also, crop off the left edge to omit whatever that dark bit is near the upper left corner. Consider cropping off some of the foreground too.', '2008-05-07 23:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4688986, 676489, 62249, '<td valign="top">The three elements of your triangle (person and two birds) are too far apart to seem like a real composition.</td>', 'The three elements of your triangle (person and two birds) are too far apart to seem like a real composition.', '2008-05-07 23:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
