(4689767, 676339, 88718, '<td valign="top">This is very simple but very nice lighting. Makes it look crisp and even edible. Can you eat ferns?</td>', 'This is very simple but very nice lighting. Makes it look crisp and even edible. Can you eat ferns?', '2008-05-08 08:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
