(4689950, 676400, 74637, '<td valign="top">very cute, the raccoon is focused nicely.<br/> <br/>must say the blurring accross its nose does detract slightly :)</td>', 'very cute, the raccoon is focused nicely. must say the blurring accross its nose does detract slightly :)', '2008-05-08 10:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
