(4689960, 676400, 89333, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the V in the tree. I find the fringing on the twig to be distracting.</td>', 'I like the use of the V in the tree. I find the fringing on the twig to be distracting.', '2008-05-08 10:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4689963, 676405, 74637, '<td valign="top">clever concept.<br/>Personally i would have focused on a single triangle, or at least centralised one but thats just me :)</td>', 'clever concept.Personally i would have focused on a single triangle, or at least centralised one but thats just me :)', '2008-05-08 10:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4689964, 676603, 89333, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Great use of wide-angle distortion. Very good exposure. It''s too bad you couldn''t remove the tree on the left edge.</td>', 'Excellent. Great use of wide-angle distortion. Very good exposure. It''s too bad you couldn''t remove the tree on the left edge.', '2008-05-08 10:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4689971, 675552, 88254, '<td valign="top">Very moving picture, difficult to make out these are headstones.  I don''t see triangle composition though, unless I really stretch, so I have to mark this down for not meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Very moving picture, difficult to make out these are headstones.  I don''t see triangle composition though, unless I really stretch, so I have to mark this down for not meeting the challenge.', '2008-05-08 10:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4689973, 676637, 89333, '<td valign="top">Good exposure as there is detail in both the white and black feathers. Unfortunately, the image doesn''t work for me. The blue box is very distracting as is the orange roof. Also, the front curb "decapitates" the goose while the back curb merges with the neck.</td>', 'Good exposure as there is detail in both the white and black feathers. Unfortunately, the image doesn''t work for me. The blue box is very distracting as is the orange roof. Also, the front curb "decapitates" the goose while the back curb merges with the neck.', '2008-05-08 10:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4689978, 676146, 74637, '<td valign="top">wow... how did you get the cork to do that?</td>', 'wow... how did you get the cork to do that?', '2008-05-08 10:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4689981, 676701, 74637, '<td valign="top">good idea but just too dark (in my opinion)   :)</td>', 'good idea but just too dark (in my opinion)   :)', '2008-05-08 10:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4689983, 676121, 89333, '<td valign="top">Good composition. It needs to be a bit sharper, especially the eye. I would have also liked to see it cropped from the top to above the crossed branches (eliminating the leaves in the upper-right corner. (It would also be better without the very bottom branch, but I realize you could not eliminate this.)</td>', 'Good composition. It needs to be a bit sharper, especially the eye. I would have also liked to see it cropped from the top to above the crossed branches (eliminating the leaves in the upper-right corner. (It would also be better without the very bottom branch, but I realize you could not eliminate this.)', '2008-05-08 10:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4689987, 676709, 74637, '<td valign="top">hehe nice one, made me chuckle</td>', 'hehe nice one, made me chuckle', '2008-05-08 10:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4689992, 676613, 89333, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The only thing I would have preferred is to see the blue extend all the way to the lower left corner as I find the white stripe a bit distracting. (I think you could have also cropped it out without degrading the image.)</td>', 'Very nice. The only thing I would have preferred is to see the blue extend all the way to the lower left corner as I find the white stripe a bit distracting. (I think you could have also cropped it out without degrading the image.)', '2008-05-08 10:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4689998, 675632, 89333, '<td valign="top">Ingenious use of the triangle. I think I would have preferred to have the left shell moved a bit to the right to tighten the image. The back shell look a bit unsharp, but I think that''s an artifact of the small size.</td>', 'Ingenious use of the triangle. I think I would have preferred to have the left shell moved a bit to the right to tighten the image. The back shell look a bit unsharp, but I think that''s an artifact of the small size.', '2008-05-08 10:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690006, 676809, 74637, '<td valign="top">i really like the way this is cropped, and black and white was a perfect choice. i''ll give you an 8 for it :)</td>', 'i really like the way this is cropped, and black and white was a perfect choice. i''ll give you an 8 for it :)', '2008-05-08 10:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690007, 675529, 74637, '<td valign="top">i dont think this fits within the editing guidelines but its a good idea, maybe if you used perspective to acheive the effect rather than editing.</td>', 'i dont think this fits within the editing guidelines but its a good idea, maybe if you used perspective to acheive the effect rather than editing.', '2008-05-08 10:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
