(4690095, 676749, 89333, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. However, the flower, especially the center, needs to be sharper. I would have also preferred the flower shifted to the left so it was "looking" into the frame instead of out of it. (I realize this may not have been possible due to the background.)</td>', 'Nice idea. However, the flower, especially the center, needs to be sharper. I would have also preferred the flower shifted to the left so it was "looking" into the frame instead of out of it. (I realize this may not have been possible due to the background.)', '2008-05-08 11:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690097, 675275, 55956, '<td valign="top">I think that was a better choice without the boat because it break the simmetry of the image.</td>', 'I think that was a better choice without the boat because it break the simmetry of the image.', '2008-05-08 11:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690098, 676376, 55956, '<td valign="top">I like it.</td>', 'I like it.', '2008-05-08 11:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690109, 676689, 89333, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. I like the bird poses. I think it''s a bit overexposed as the back of the geese don''t have detail. It also would have been better without the front reeds. (I understand there was nothing you could do about these.)</td>', 'Interesting image. I like the bird poses. I think it''s a bit overexposed as the back of the geese don''t have detail. It also would have been better without the front reeds. (I understand there was nothing you could do about these.)', '2008-05-08 11:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690118, 676647, 89333, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. While having the gem in the upper right is unconventional, it makes for a much more dramatic image. (I like it a lot.) I find the bright white band at the right distracting.</td>', 'Interesting image. While having the gem in the upper right is unconventional, it makes for a much more dramatic image. (I like it a lot.) I find the bright white band at the right distracting.', '2008-05-08 11:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690165, 676618, 91342, '<td valign="top">I would crop on the right side.</td>', 'I would crop on the right side.', '2008-05-08 11:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690172, 675390, 91342, '<td valign="top">I would crop the lower portion of the photo; it detracts from the triangle around the animals.</td>', 'I would crop the lower portion of the photo; it detracts from the triangle around the animals.', '2008-05-08 11:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690186, 676709, 91342, '<td valign="top">I''d crop just below the paws.</td>', 'I''d crop just below the paws.', '2008-05-08 11:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
