(4690336, 676339, 91716, '<td valign="top">Great colors, very sharp and for me the best in this challenge - 10</td>', 'Great colors, very sharp and for me the best in this challenge - 10', '2008-05-08 13:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690406, 676703, 84124, '<td valign="top">superb!</td>', 'superb!', '2008-05-08 13:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690411, 676613, 84124, '<td valign="top">We''ll see this one on the front page.</td>', 'We''ll see this one on the front page.', '2008-05-08 13:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690451, 676459, 39679, '<td valign="top">Wow...spectacular colors</td>', 'Wow...spectacular colors', '2008-05-08 14:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690455, 676646, 39679, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  It''s interesting in that it''s a bright sunny day which makes for a feeling of happiness yet, with the slight "fisheye" distortion, it looks just a little sinister.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  It''s interesting in that it''s a bright sunny day which makes for a feeling of happiness yet, with the slight "fisheye" distortion, it looks just a little sinister.', '2008-05-08 14:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690458, 676743, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot but I''m not getting the challenge from it.</td>', 'This is a cool shot but I''m not getting the challenge from it.', '2008-05-08 14:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690462, 676381, 39679, '<td valign="top">Wow...with the clouds being below the summit, you really get a sense of the size and majesty of the mountain.  Nice job.</td>', 'Wow...with the clouds being below the summit, you really get a sense of the size and majesty of the mountain.  Nice job.', '2008-05-08 14:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690464, 676154, 39679, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but, for some reason, it doesn''t look centered to me.  I think it''s because your model is leaning slightly to the left as you look at the shot. Other than that this is a nice shot.  It''s sensual without being overt.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Nice shot but, for some reason, it doesn''t look centered to me.  I think it''s because your model is leaning slightly to the left as you look at the shot. Other than that this is a nice shot.  It''s sensual without being overt.  Nicely done.', '2008-05-08 14:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690467, 675521, 39679, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  Well done.  With the way you''ve lit this, it has a hand painted look and by not placing the models (your) feet at the bottom of the frame, you''ve put more emphasis on the subject and created greater impact.  Really good shot and nice legs too.  ;)</td>', 'Very cool!  Well done.  With the way you''ve lit this, it has a hand painted look and by not placing the models (your) feet at the bottom of the frame, you''ve put more emphasis on the subject and created greater impact.  Really good shot and nice legs too.  ;)', '2008-05-08 14:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690472, 676245, 39679, '<td valign="top">Ouch indeed.  How in the world did you talk your subject into doing that?</td>', 'Ouch indeed.  How in the world did you talk your subject into doing that?', '2008-05-08 14:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690478, 676796, 5364, '<td valign="top">I can see your triangle, but it''s all very blured</td>', 'I can see your triangle, but it''s all very blured', '2008-05-08 14:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690547, 676847, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot.  Having a polarizer might have helped to increase the density a bit (darkening the sky) and made better separation between the building and the sky.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot.  Having a polarizer might have helped to increase the density a bit (darkening the sky) and made better separation between the building and the sky.', '2008-05-08 15:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690549, 676638, 39679, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of DOF.  Including the flowers in the background really helps to add a sense of depth to this photo.</td>', 'Very nice use of DOF.  Including the flowers in the background really helps to add a sense of depth to this photo.', '2008-05-08 15:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690599, 676770, 80458, '<td valign="top">this looks way overprocessed to me.</td>', 'this looks way overprocessed to me.', '2008-05-08 16:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4690602, 676613, 80458, '<td valign="top">beautiful.</td>', 'beautiful.', '2008-05-08 16:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
