(4691056, 676087, 65234, '<td valign="top">Really like this one.  It manages to convey the innocence of children playing in the mist with a grownup''s fear of what may be hiding in the mist and darkness.  In my mind, anyway.  And the implied triangle leads my eye from the girl in front to her two playmates.  One of my top picks in this challenge.</td>', 'Really like this one.  It manages to convey the innocence of children playing in the mist with a grownup''s fear of what may be hiding in the mist and darkness.  In my mind, anyway.  And the implied triangle leads my eye from the girl in front to her two playmates.  One of my top picks in this challenge.', '2008-05-08 18:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4691070, 676589, 65234, '<td valign="top">The triangle adds a bit of extra interest to a fun shot. Nice, subtle colors let the shadow draw my eye</td>', 'The triangle adds a bit of extra interest to a fun shot. Nice, subtle colors let the shadow draw my eye', '2008-05-08 18:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
