(4691211, 676684, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the focus isn''t the best (hand shake?) and the buildings to the right are a distraction amidst all those great leading lines. Also, the underexposed bottom of the image doesn''t do much. And the lighting''s not the most flattering -- playing with the color balance might have helped, but shooting under different lighting conditions (earlier or later in the day) is a better bet. Probably more than you wanted to hear from me, but I love these kinds of shots (and architecture is my specialty if I have one). <br/> <br/>This is a great composition and idea, but I would have fits trying to get an effective crop out of it.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the focus isn''t the best (hand shake?) and the buildings to the right are a distraction amidst all those great leading lines. Also, the underexposed bottom of the image doesn''t do much. And the lighting''s not the most flattering -- playing with the color balance might have helped, but shooting under different lighting conditions (earlier or later in the day) is a better bet. Probably more than you wanted to hear from me, but I love these kinds of shots (and architecture is my specialty if I have one).  This is a great composition and idea, but I would have fits trying to get an effective crop out of it.', '2008-05-08 20:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
