(4694354, 676667, 91496, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  A catchier title could be "Exploding into Angles".  I put "triangle" in my title and I think it is maybe to overt to call it out.</td>', 'Very nice.  A catchier title could be "Exploding into Angles".  I put "triangle" in my title and I think it is maybe to overt to call it out.', '2008-05-10 23:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
