(4694363, 676772, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Might be a little too much going on here. All the angles, the foreground, the background, and the light source are competing to be the subject.</td>', 'Nice.  Might be a little too much going on here. All the angles, the foreground, the background, and the light source are competing to be the subject.', '2008-05-10 23:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4694365, 676638, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Title might try to add mystery rather the give instructions.  Try "Angles of Purple" or something along those line.</td>', 'Nice photo.  Title might try to add mystery rather the give instructions.  Try "Angles of Purple" or something along those line.', '2008-05-10 23:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4694366, 676276, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The super white pavement sort of dominates the left half of the photo.  Maybe a portrait crop would have put focus on the person and shadow.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The super white pavement sort of dominates the left half of the photo.  Maybe a portrait crop would have put focus on the person and shadow.', '2008-05-10 23:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4694370, 676691, 91496, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  At first glance, the glove looked like a severed zombie hand and the shovel like a another body part that I will not name.  Only after taking a second look did the acutal context become clear.  Might just be me :)</td>', 'Very nice.  At first glance, the glove looked like a severed zombie hand and the shovel like a another body part that I will not name.  Only after taking a second look did the acutal context become clear.  Might just be me :)', '2008-05-10 23:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
