(4694391, 676712, 91496, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  First thought was a happy one at the scene.  Second thought "where is the trangle".  Answer: it is a wonderful part of the scene, without overpowering the scene.  10 from me.</td>', 'Very nice.  First thought was a happy one at the scene.  Second thought "where is the trangle".  Answer: it is a wonderful part of the scene, without overpowering the scene.  10 from me.', '2008-05-11 00:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
