(4700635, 676244, 50517, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the votes and comments !<br/> <br/>I must thank <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=82461" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">pramodvh</a> not only for his company during the shot but also for his camera! :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-05-14 00:22:50.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the votes and comments ! I must thank  pramodvh not only for his company during the shot but also for his camera! :)', '2008-05-14 01:20:32.000000', '2008-05-14 01:22:50.000000', 0),
