(4700708, 676547, 48471, '<td valign="top">The frame makes it look as if I''m seeing this through a window, something that doesn''t work good here. Maybe you meant to confine the space and the lack of a point of attention, but...<br/> <br/>As for the rest, you know you''re quite a master of astrophotography and you don''t need me to tell you that.</td>', 'The frame makes it look as if I''m seeing this through a window, something that doesn''t work good here. Maybe you meant to confine the space and the lack of a point of attention, but... As for the rest, you know you''re quite a master of astrophotography and you don''t need me to tell you that.', '2008-05-14 01:36:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4700713, 676620, 66384, '<td valign="top">The triangle composition works so well for this scene. It''s lovely. And you even have triangle ice.</td>', 'The triangle composition works so well for this scene. It''s lovely. And you even have triangle ice.', '2008-05-14 01:36:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4700714, 675529, 12243, '<td valign="top">excellent Michael :D very clever shot!</td>', 'excellent Michael :D very clever shot!', '2008-05-14 01:36:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4700719, 676439, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like how Mary has the kids going one way, and you have the other view.  Also funny that she went with B&amp;W and you went with color.  You two should work together.  The color choice is perfect here to enhance the sense of fun and energy.  Adorable moment.  Congrats on 15th place!</td>', 'I like how Mary has the kids going one way, and you have the other view.  Also funny that she went with B&W and you went with color.  You two should work together.  The color choice is perfect here to enhance the sense of fun and energy.  Adorable moment.  Congrats on 15th place!', '2008-05-14 01:37:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4700720, 675529, 52549, '<td valign="top">Great, creative shot, Michael. Huge congrats on your ribbon.</td>', 'Great, creative shot, Michael. Huge congrats on your ribbon.', '2008-05-14 01:37:47.000000', NULL, 0),
