(4700761, 675427, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. I love the colors and textures. I''m really surprised this didn''t score higher. I like the blue, but I think it would also be a very nice image with the top cropped. Square crop would be simple and strong.</td>', 'Very interesting. I love the colors and textures. I''m really surprised this didn''t score higher. I like the blue, but I think it would also be a very nice image with the top cropped. Square crop would be simple and strong.', '2008-05-14 01:47:41.000000', NULL, 0),
