(4701240, 675529, 77192, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a well-deserved ribbon! This was my favourite of the challenge :-)<br/> <br/>It just goes to show that originally wins out here in the end :-) I must admit I agree with those who say it could do with a little bit of sharpening and extra saturation, but I gave you a 10 and stand by it! Well done!<br/> <br/>I didn''t realise when voting it was a paper version of her. I though it was a trampoline and clever use of perspective that did it. Great nonetheless!</td>', 'Congrats on a well-deserved ribbon! This was my favourite of the challenge :-) It just goes to show that originally wins out here in the end :-) I must admit I agree with those who say it could do with a little bit of sharpening and extra saturation, but I gave you a 10 and stand by it! Well done! I didn''t realise when voting it was a paper version of her. I though it was a trampoline and clever use of perspective that did it. Great nonetheless!', '2008-05-14 08:09:22.000000', NULL, 0),
