(4701291, 676236, 92974, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  It did OK for a first try, I guess.  <br/> <br/>To bobnospum, the statue is the Soviet Era Russian - Ukrainian Friendship Statue, in Kiev, Ukraine.  So it''s likely just a generic Russian and a generic Ukrainian.  But since they are now seperate countries, I added the " ? " since especially the Ukrainians want to forget the Russian/Soviet past.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  It did OK for a first try, I guess.   To bobnospum, the statue is the Soviet Era Russian - Ukrainian Friendship Statue, in Kiev, Ukraine.  So it''s likely just a generic Russian and a generic Ukrainian.  But since they are now seperate countries, I added the " ? " since especially the Ukrainians want to forget the Russian/Soviet past.', '2008-05-14 08:45:29.000000', NULL, 0),
