(4701531, 676648, 48228, '<td valign="top">I do see the graffiti inside the framed triangles, now that you pointed it out to us. <br/> <br/>My only suggestion is that maybe a tighter crop, taking away the top part and making it a square crop format, may have made your message stronger. <br/> <br/>Loosing the top area, make the image less busy or distracting, and one then concentrates on the framed triangles, that draws one right into the center of the image, to see the graffiti, like you wanted them to..... <br/> <br/>I hope this makes sense.....</td>', 'I do see the graffiti inside the framed triangles, now that you pointed it out to us.  My only suggestion is that maybe a tighter crop, taking away the top part and making it a square crop format, may have made your message stronger.  Loosing the top area, make the image less busy or distracting, and one then concentrates on the framed triangles, that draws one right into the center of the image, to see the graffiti, like you wanted them to.....  I hope this makes sense.....', '2008-05-14 10:29:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4701576, 676613, 52115, '<td valign="top">The idea of using negative space has not been done very much here. Great idea.<br/> <br/>Maybe people yearn for simplicity since we''re constantly bombarded and over saturated with media from all angles and avenues.<br/> <br/>WOW, this must be "Irene Month". What''s the record for Ribbons-Per-Month?</td>', 'The idea of using negative space has not been done very much here. Great idea. Maybe people yearn for simplicity since we''re constantly bombarded and over saturated with media from all angles and avenues. WOW, this must be "Irene Month". What''s the record for Ribbons-Per-Month?', '2008-05-14 10:36:11.000000', NULL, 0),
