(4701918, 676691, 61315, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the votes and comments, and for those who don''t garden, the gloves are specially dipped in rubber to make them waterproof and the tool is a gardening trowel. Since I see and use this frequently, I thought everyone else would recognize them but I guess I was mistaken! :-)</td>', 'Thanks for the votes and comments, and for those who don''t garden, the gloves are specially dipped in rubber to make them waterproof and the tool is a gardening trowel. Since I see and use this frequently, I thought everyone else would recognize them but I guess I was mistaken! :-)', '2008-05-14 12:25:06.000000', NULL, 0),
