(4702253, 676087, 50695, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, this is beautiful! Your shot is very different than <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=61651" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">krnodil</a>''s, because she left more of the context in. Here, the children are lost in a mystery mist. But you probably scored higher because the sense of a "triangle" is stronger. Even so, I''m thrilled to see such a great picture score well.</td>', 'Oh wow, this is beautiful! Your shot is very different than  krnodil''s, because she left more of the context in. Here, the children are lost in a mystery mist. But you probably scored higher because the sense of a "triangle" is stronger. Even so, I''m thrilled to see such a great picture score well.', '2008-05-14 15:47:30.000000', NULL, 0),
