(4703115, 675521, 85886, '<td valign="top">Way to go Jules!  I''m in self imposed exile in Delft in .nl, away from internet, but I saw this in the weekly update mail that went around - am SOOOOO happy for you.  THis is a f***** awesome shot - you rule :)  Is this from the same diehard ''sod ps, gimme a torch, a bowie knife and a dark room''?? So classy, so evocative, brilliantly developed....perfect postcard nostalgia.  Very best, N</td>', 'Way to go Jules!  I''m in self imposed exile in Delft in .nl, away from internet, but I saw this in the weekly update mail that went around - am SOOOOO happy for you.  THis is a f***** awesome shot - you rule :)  Is this from the same diehard ''sod ps, gimme a torch, a bowie knife and a dark room''?? So classy, so evocative, brilliantly developed....perfect postcard nostalgia.  Very best, N', '2008-05-14 23:10:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4703139, 676648, 48228, '<td valign="top">Well deserved.....<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by chromeydome:</b></div><hr/><i> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee! </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Well deserved..... Originally posted by chromeydome: PostLuminous Award Nominee! ', '2008-05-14 23:20:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4703257, 676837, 70514, '<td valign="top">You captured your sentiments beautifully.  I love this as it reminds me a bit of his gorgeous sister, but also reminds me of his beautiful face in his other portrait you took.  Stunning.  Beautiful detail, lovely conversion.  I appreciate you not spoon feeding the audience, they need to wait for it...then, aha!  (good things come to those who wait!)  :)</td>', 'You captured your sentiments beautifully.  I love this as it reminds me a bit of his gorgeous sister, but also reminds me of his beautiful face in his other portrait you took.  Stunning.  Beautiful detail, lovely conversion.  I appreciate you not spoon feeding the audience, they need to wait for it...then, aha!  (good things come to those who wait!)  :)', '2008-05-14 23:48:20.000000', NULL, 0),
