(4703791, 675521, 67145, '<td valign="top">this is absolutely brilliant .. came to your portfolio by way of leo and the dpc hats .. !! .. wot a nice surprise .. !! .. this definitely deserved a higher score in my opinion .. so excellent .. :)<br/>just noticed you got 5 1''s .. WOT !!<br/>i really wonder about those voters .. who are they? and wot''s their problem .??. consistently when voting starts i get 4''s and very low votes .. this on images that end up in the 6''s .. it just doesnt make sense to get such a difference of opinion unless a whole heap of those ppl are mentally challenged .. anyway .. sorry to go on .. but looking at the breakdown on this its just plain weird .. :)<br/></td>', 'this is absolutely brilliant .. came to your portfolio by way of leo and the dpc hats .. !! .. wot a nice surprise .. !! .. this definitely deserved a higher score in my opinion .. so excellent .. :)just noticed you got 5 1''s .. WOT !!i really wonder about those voters .. who are they? and wot''s their problem .??. consistently when voting starts i get 4''s and very low votes .. this on images that end up in the 6''s .. it just doesnt make sense to get such a difference of opinion unless a whole heap of those ppl are mentally challenged .. anyway .. sorry to go on .. but looking at the breakdown on this its just plain weird .. :)', '2008-05-15 08:45:55.000000', NULL, 0),
