(4704162, 675632, 51538, '<td valign="top">Glad you came to DPC.  Now I can enjoy seeing some good photos of Greece.  The links in your profile to your Facebook gallery are no good to me - since I do not belong to the Facebook crowd and hate having to register just to see someones photos.  Facebook will be a thing of the past soon.  I hope to see more of your photos on DPC though.</td>', 'Glad you came to DPC.  Now I can enjoy seeing some good photos of Greece.  The links in your profile to your Facebook gallery are no good to me - since I do not belong to the Facebook crowd and hate having to register just to see someones photos.  Facebook will be a thing of the past soon.  I hope to see more of your photos on DPC though.', '2008-05-15 11:30:29.000000', NULL, 0),
