(4718465, 676244, 48228, '<td valign="top">This does suit the challenge, but not in a strong way, but it is there.<br/> <br/>Nice focus on the eyes, but I feel the background could be more interesting. A little hard when taking photos of these little critters, as one often has to take the image where one finds them. <br/> <br/>I have taken photos of these in there own environment, but also in an environment that I choose. I have carefully captured the praying mantis, with no harm done and placed it on a leaf, or flower of my choosing. One must take care with going this and not harm the insect in any way. One must also place the insect back where one found it without any harm to it.....<br/> <br/>I like the softness of the DOF as well.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-05-22 22:15:57.</i></td>', 'This does suit the challenge, but not in a strong way, but it is there. Nice focus on the eyes, but I feel the background could be more interesting. A little hard when taking photos of these little critters, as one often has to take the image where one finds them.  I have taken photos of these in there own environment, but also in an environment that I choose. I have carefully captured the praying mantis, with no harm done and placed it on a leaf, or flower of my choosing. One must take care with going this and not harm the insect in any way. One must also place the insect back where one found it without any harm to it..... I like the softness of the DOF as well.', '2008-05-22 23:15:00.000000', '2008-05-22 23:15:57.000000', 0),
(4724622, 676620, 68035, '<td valign="top">Ho hum...''just'' another iceberg shot eh?  I love it, such a cool inferred triangle with the horizon and the strong leading diagonal<br/> <br/>I <u><b>LOVE</b></u> the processing the sea is an incredible green colour<br/> <br/>Wild and untamed imagery.  Super</td>', 'Ho hum...''just'' another iceberg shot eh?  I love it, such a cool inferred triangle with the horizon and the strong leading diagonal I LOVE the processing the sea is an incredible green colour Wild and untamed imagery.  Super', '2008-05-26 11:04:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4726652, 676766, 45475, '<td valign="top">Simply meeting the challenge isn''t everything. You have to work on exceptional composition. Crop out the oof pole on the left, it adds nothing but visual distraction, and you have a totally different shot.</td>', 'Simply meeting the challenge isn''t everything. You have to work on exceptional composition. Crop out the oof pole on the left, it adds nothing but visual distraction, and you have a totally different shot.', '2008-05-27 01:13:01.000000', NULL, 0),
