(5598743, 675521, 37252, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>The idea here was very creative. Love the colors and shapes. Very good lighting also.<br/>My only nit pik here is the amount of empty space. I feel you have a just a bit too much. My recommendation would be to trim the bottom just a bit.<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club The idea here was very creative. Love the colors and shapes. Very good lighting also.My only nit pik here is the amount of empty space. I feel you have a just a bit too much. My recommendation would be to trim the bottom just a bit.', '2009-08-04 20:06:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5765688, 676194, 65234, '<td valign="top">I see his Red Belly!  Marvelous detail.  I get these guys occasionally at my birdfeeders but have always thought they were misnamed, given the bright orange caps which distinguish them from other woodpeckers.  But apparently they do have red bellies!  I feel somewhat enlightened ;-)  And I totally envy you the chance to play with such a lens!!</td>', 'I see his Red Belly!  Marvelous detail.  I get these guys occasionally at my birdfeeders but have always thought they were misnamed, given the bright orange caps which distinguish them from other woodpeckers.  But apparently they do have red bellies!  I feel somewhat enlightened ;-)  And I totally envy you the chance to play with such a lens!!', '2009-12-13 18:28:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6189858, 676617, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is quite lovely; I''d missed it before. Not all that challenge-relevant, but a beautiful image. Radiates serenity and peace :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-10-12 22:50:58.</i></td>', 'This is quite lovely; I''d missed it before. Not all that challenge-relevant, but a beautiful image. Radiates serenity and peace :-)', '2010-10-12 23:50:41.000000', '2010-10-12 23:50:58.000000', 0);
